// Windows resource for the Natalia executables — GENERATED from this template
// by CMake (configure_file), which substitutes the icon's absolute path.
//
// Why a template rather than a plain .rc: the resource compiler resolves
// relative paths against its own working directory, which CMake does not
// promise to be anything in particular. A path that resolves on one machine
// and silently produces an icon-less exe on another is not worth the
// convenience of writing "icon.ico" directly.
//
// What this covers beyond simple_app.cc's SetWindowAppIcon (which handles the
// running window on every platform): the window CLASS icon that
// simple_tray_win.cc reads back for the tray, the icon Explorer shows for the
// .exe file itself, and the launcher executable, which never creates a window
// of its own to decorate.
IDI_APPICON ICON "@NATALIA_APP_ICON_ICO@"
